    {
      "id": "claim_ba8daff5b7314db992ba943f1ce6a5dd",
      "statement": "Invoices.create handles invoice creation in two input modes: JSON (routing to ESP e-wallet or ESHOP MSP connectors via Main.mspConnectors) and VPC (decoding Base64 merchant data and dispatching to the first matching MSPConnector).",
